WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.520 --> 01:35.440
Only then

01:36.520 --> 01:39.240
can you heal more illnesses
and save more lives.

01:40.320 --> 01:42.480
So your talent and benevolence
won't be wasted.

01:43.800 --> 01:47.680
So, I will do my best

01:50.800 --> 01:52.720
to eradicate all the obstacles for you.

01:58.360 --> 02:01.520
Song Huaiyou was the second person
Pei Yu killed for you.

02:01.600 --> 02:04.240
The prescription
made him realize that it was you

02:04.320 --> 02:05.800
who dissected the bodies.

02:09.400 --> 02:11.000
The symptoms of inner dampness

02:11.080 --> 02:12.920
only surface in the end.

02:13.000 --> 02:15.200
It can't be diagnosed through observation,
listening, and smelling.

02:18.040 --> 02:18.880
It was you.

02:28.360 --> 02:29.360
Come here.

02:31.960 --> 02:32.920
Tell me.

02:34.160 --> 02:35.680
You went to the mortuary?

02:39.440 --> 02:40.440
You…

02:40.520 --> 02:43.120
What did you do?

02:48.760 --> 02:51.040
Tomorrow morning,
the mortuary carriage will leave.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.000
Hop on and run away.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.000
Why?

02:53.720 --> 02:56.160
Why? Unauthorized autopsy
is a capital offense.

02:56.240 --> 02:58.560
Once discovered,
both of us will be executed.

02:58.640 --> 03:00.600
I did that to save people.

03:00.680 --> 03:01.560
What did I do wrong?

03:02.640 --> 03:04.440
Besides, I was very careful.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.480
They won't find out.

03:06.120 --> 03:08.040
I don't have time for this.

03:09.760 --> 03:11.160
To stay alive,

03:12.520 --> 03:13.680
you have to go.

03:19.120 --> 03:21.920
But promise me
you'll try this prescription.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.240
How dare you mention the prescription?

03:24.320 --> 03:25.280
Physician Song.

03:27.920 --> 03:30.600
Stay in the dispensary. Don't go anywhere.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.840
Tomorrow morning, I'll pick you up.

03:36.000 --> 03:37.200
Master.

03:37.880 --> 03:38.960
FOOD DELIVERY RECORD
OF IMPERIAL FOOD SERVICE

03:41.760 --> 03:44.240
This is what Physician Song
had for dinner that night.

03:44.320 --> 03:45.320
Lamb noodle soup.

03:45.400 --> 03:47.480
Dang Gui, jujube,
and donkey-hide gelatin paste.

03:48.440 --> 03:51.280
When these ingredients are combined,
they can disrupt the flow of energy

03:51.360 --> 03:52.880
and blood circulation.

03:53.400 --> 03:55.400
Coupled with emotional agitation,

03:55.480 --> 03:57.360
it could induce a stroke.

03:58.520 --> 04:01.920
After Physician Song consumed
the specially prepared food,

04:02.000 --> 04:04.800
Pei Yu waited to show up
during his eye-steaming treatment.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.360
He revealed his identity
and warned to ruin everyone

04:07.960 --> 04:10.640
if Physician Song tried to send you away.

04:11.240 --> 04:13.160
Physician Song was overwhelmed with fury.

04:13.240 --> 04:16.320
The acute stroke rendered him powerless.

04:16.399 --> 04:17.880
Pei Yu dragged him to the table

04:18.680 --> 04:20.720
and submerged his face in the water,

04:21.360 --> 04:23.600
creating the false appearance

04:24.440 --> 04:25.600
that he died by accident.

04:28.680 --> 04:30.040
It's all my fault.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.280
It's all my fault.

04:39.800 --> 04:41.440
Why did you kill him?

04:42.520 --> 04:43.600
I said

04:46.400 --> 04:48.040
I won't let anyone stand in your way.

04:49.680 --> 04:51.280
But he was my master.

04:51.360 --> 04:53.320
Did you forget what you want to do?

04:53.400 --> 04:55.240
If you don't want him to die in vain,

04:55.320 --> 04:57.000
take this opportunity.

04:57.080 --> 05:00.120
Put your prescription into use
and impress His Majesty.

05:03.080 --> 05:04.520
You are the best physician.

05:05.920 --> 05:07.760
I won't let anyone get in your way.

05:12.000 --> 05:12.960
You should go back.

05:26.160 --> 05:28.040
You will soon have a chance to shine.

05:35.320 --> 05:36.720
After he killed Master,

05:37.320 --> 05:39.480
I was determined not to see him again.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.320
But he did not stop.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.440
Huang Futong was killed.

05:44.520 --> 05:46.520
He did what he promised.

05:47.320 --> 05:49.120
No one stood in my way anymore.

05:50.400 --> 05:52.720
But I just couldn't develop
a new prescription.

05:53.440 --> 05:55.520
I sneaked to the mortuary late at night

05:56.280 --> 05:58.280
when the guards were away
and cut open the body

05:58.360 --> 05:59.600
to look for the focus.

06:02.440 --> 06:04.520
But there was no progress.

06:08.280 --> 06:09.160
Until…

06:14.160 --> 06:15.360
Let me out.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.960
More people are getting infected.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.240
Having trouble with the new prescription?

06:25.920 --> 06:28.200
You don't care about people's lives.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.520
Why care about the prescription?

06:31.400 --> 06:34.080
If you want to kill someone, just kill me.

06:34.160 --> 06:35.480
You sneaked into the mortuary

06:36.160 --> 06:37.600
to check those bodies, right?

06:57.880 --> 06:59.760
Nice sunshine.

07:05.520 --> 07:06.800
You got infected?

07:12.080 --> 07:13.640
Is it too late?

07:13.720 --> 07:14.840
What?

07:17.760 --> 07:19.960
Those bodies have been there for too long.

07:21.800 --> 07:24.120
You can't locate the focus anymore.

07:24.200 --> 07:25.120
It's pointless.

07:26.640 --> 07:28.440
- Pei Yu.
- No, you're Pei Yu,

07:31.400 --> 07:33.200
the best physician
in the Imperial Medical Office.

07:36.520 --> 07:38.680
I'm sure you can find a cure for this.

07:39.760 --> 07:41.120
No.

07:45.080 --> 07:46.240
Pei Yu.

07:48.880 --> 07:49.760
Pei Yu.

07:56.440 --> 07:57.320
Hurry.

07:57.400 --> 07:59.280
No.

08:01.440 --> 08:02.280
Hurry.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.400
Hurry.

08:27.320 --> 08:28.160
Pei Yu.

08:35.840 --> 08:36.840
Pei Yu.

08:57.960 --> 09:02.560
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

09:04.720 --> 09:06.880
The prejudice within
the Imperial Medical Office is to blame.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.320
Just because Ying is a woman,

09:10.400 --> 09:13.680
they disregarded her judgment
and delayed treatment,

09:14.200 --> 09:15.760
causing the epidemic outbreak.

09:16.280 --> 09:19.680
I just hope that one day,
women can face a little less prejudice.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.960
You're being too pessimistic.

09:24.040 --> 09:26.960
Why settle for "less"
when we can aim for "none"?

09:28.280 --> 09:29.480
Of course, that'd be better.

09:30.600 --> 09:33.360
I just assume
there's still a long, long way to go.

09:35.240 --> 09:38.080
It's alright. Your Ladyship is not alone.

09:38.160 --> 09:41.280
A lot of people will stand by you.

09:45.560 --> 09:48.520
These crimes were committed by Xia Shisan.

09:48.600 --> 09:50.800
But Ying didn't report him.

09:50.880 --> 09:53.440
Once the epidemic is over
and the palace gate opens,

09:53.520 --> 09:55.680
deliver the files
to the Court of Judicial Review.

09:57.920 --> 09:58.960
Your Ladyship.

09:59.680 --> 10:02.160
Your Ladyship, bad news. It's Pei Yu.

10:03.600 --> 10:04.480
Pei Yu.

10:06.520 --> 10:08.120
Technician Pei committed suicide.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.480
Thankfully, they found out.

10:11.880 --> 10:13.000
She took poison.

10:25.200 --> 10:26.240
Here.

10:33.320 --> 10:35.800
I've written my confession.

10:36.720 --> 10:39.120
Don't bother the Court of Judicial Review.

10:39.960 --> 10:41.280
I just want a quick death.

10:42.680 --> 10:43.840
Don't commit suicide.

10:43.920 --> 10:44.920
You're not the culprit.

10:51.520 --> 10:53.400
Heed His Majesty's decree!

10:57.240 --> 11:00.320
"The new prescription
from Technician Pei has managed

11:00.400 --> 11:03.400
to contain the epidemic
since it was put into use.

11:03.480 --> 11:06.320
No more patients died,

11:06.400 --> 11:08.680
and there were no new cases.

11:08.760 --> 11:12.240
Technician Pei has made
great contributions

11:12.320 --> 11:14.920
and is summoned by His Majesty."

11:15.000 --> 11:16.280
Accept the decree!

11:32.160 --> 11:34.480
I, Pei Yu, the convict,
pay respect to Your Majesty.

11:37.080 --> 11:37.920
Rise.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.480
Your prescription

11:41.080 --> 11:42.240
worked wonders.

11:42.760 --> 11:45.120
It stopped the epidemic

11:45.200 --> 11:47.400
and saved hundreds
of people in the palace.

11:48.160 --> 11:49.680
The credit goes to you.

11:49.760 --> 11:51.520
There is no credit.

11:51.600 --> 11:53.400
It's just my duty as a physician.

11:54.920 --> 11:57.160
Conducting an unauthorized autopsy
is a capital crime,

11:57.760 --> 12:00.800
and I sheltered the culprit
after he killed my mentor.

12:00.880 --> 12:02.440
I shall be punished.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.680
Please grant me death, Your Majesty.

12:06.200 --> 12:08.680
Your Majesty. Please think twice.

12:08.760 --> 12:11.760
Pei Yu made mistakes,
but she saved hundreds of people,

12:11.840 --> 12:13.760
offsetting her sin.
She doesn't deserve to die.

12:14.840 --> 12:17.040
I've read the case file.

12:17.120 --> 12:20.400
The murderer Xia Shisan
was cruel and extreme.

12:20.480 --> 12:23.480
Pei Yu repeatedly covered up his crimes

12:23.560 --> 12:25.960
and should be punished
for knowingly breaking the law.

12:26.040 --> 12:28.960
But this epidemic
killed too many people in the palace.

12:29.560 --> 12:33.320
I don't want any more deaths.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.440
Your Majesty.

12:40.160 --> 12:43.280
Technician Pei may have found a cure,

12:43.880 --> 12:46.360
but an unauthorized autopsy
is more than a capital crime.

12:47.160 --> 12:51.640
It filled the palace with terror
during the epidemic.

12:53.040 --> 12:56.480
It is an act of extreme cruelty
with devastating consequences.

12:57.600 --> 13:00.680
Minister Wei, every word you speak
is so lofty and righteous.

13:00.760 --> 13:02.840
But did you ever consider

13:02.920 --> 13:05.480
what drove Technician Pei
to such extremes?

13:06.160 --> 13:08.960
If the Imperial Medical Office
valued knowledge

13:09.040 --> 13:11.160
and ability over gender,

13:11.240 --> 13:14.120
if women could diagnose, prescribe,

13:14.200 --> 13:16.120
and be respected equally
as male physicians,

13:16.200 --> 13:18.160
why would she have risked everything,

13:18.240 --> 13:20.360
even resorting to autopsies,
just to develop a cure?

13:23.160 --> 13:25.120
Your investigative skills

13:25.800 --> 13:29.520
are unmatched in the court, Your Ladyship.

13:29.600 --> 13:33.360
Yet, as a woman,
you are sometimes too emotional,

13:33.440 --> 13:35.240
prone to what one
might call "feminine leniency."

13:36.040 --> 13:38.200
Are you now trying

13:38.800 --> 13:40.960
to erase all her crimes

13:41.040 --> 13:42.920
with such words?

13:43.840 --> 13:45.080
Feminine leniency

13:45.600 --> 13:48.400
is still preferable
to your stuffy old-fashioned pedantry.

13:49.120 --> 13:51.440
- You…
- Her Ladyship was impartial.

13:51.520 --> 13:53.440
But you accused her of being partial.

13:53.520 --> 13:55.840
How disappointing.

13:57.120 --> 13:59.440
Your Majesty. Her Ladyship means

13:59.520 --> 14:02.640
that had Technician Pei
been treated fairly from the start

14:02.720 --> 14:05.440
and allowed to shine,
the epidemic might have ended sooner,

14:05.520 --> 14:08.160
and these tragedies
might never have occurred.

14:08.960 --> 14:12.040
She has achievements and faults.

14:12.120 --> 14:13.400
Let the law decide her fate.

14:13.480 --> 14:16.000
But this matter
shouldn't be viewed as a single case.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.040
Eunuch Guo.

14:22.120 --> 14:23.800
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.560
Revise the Imperial Medical Office's
regulations.

14:26.640 --> 14:29.880
All who are devoted to learning,
regardless of gender,

14:29.960 --> 14:32.400
shall be evaluated
based on their capability.

14:32.480 --> 14:34.720
Female physicians shall be accepted.

14:36.320 --> 14:37.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:38.800 --> 14:41.160
Although Pei Yu
has been involved in multiple cases,

14:41.760 --> 14:44.760
her contributions are significant,
and her attitude remains sincere.

14:44.840 --> 14:47.200
She is hereby granted a special pardon.

14:47.280 --> 14:48.760
She shall remain in the Medical Office

14:48.840 --> 14:51.200
to carry on the unfinished work
of Physician Song,

14:51.800 --> 14:53.280
study medicine,

14:53.360 --> 14:55.720
and train new practitioners
as a means of atonement.

14:56.320 --> 14:58.600
Pei Yu. What do you think?

14:59.520 --> 15:00.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

15:03.800 --> 15:06.680
I have another favor to ask.

15:07.560 --> 15:08.560
I'm listening.

15:09.160 --> 15:11.960
Your Majesty, please allow me

15:12.040 --> 15:14.840
to send Xia Shisan's ashes back home.

15:17.880 --> 15:22.120
XINGQING PALACE

16:06.640 --> 16:07.640
Ying.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.360
Headmaster.

16:10.600 --> 16:12.040
I brought Pei Yu back.

16:15.600 --> 16:17.320
It was my fault.

16:17.400 --> 16:20.080
It's all over. Say no more.

16:20.160 --> 16:21.200
Alright.

16:21.720 --> 16:23.520
I'll stop. I'll stop.

16:24.200 --> 16:26.640
Stay here and set your mind at ease.

16:27.240 --> 16:29.560
The Benevolence Hall is your home.

16:29.640 --> 16:32.160
Come on. Please come in.

16:39.760 --> 16:40.600
Come on.

16:40.680 --> 16:41.520
BENEVOLENCE HALL

16:41.600 --> 16:42.680
This way.

16:47.120 --> 16:48.400
Please…

17:06.240 --> 17:08.119
This is where Pei Yu lived as a child.

17:09.480 --> 17:11.000
I'd like to thank you and Mr. Xiao

17:11.079 --> 17:13.040
for pleading for me before His Majesty.

17:14.200 --> 17:15.640
This benefits not only me,

17:15.720 --> 17:18.079
but every woman who will study
at the Imperial Medical Office.

17:18.160 --> 17:20.560
Because you proved to His Majesty

17:20.640 --> 17:22.400
that women can also be great physicians

17:22.480 --> 17:23.599
and save lives.

17:24.560 --> 17:26.760
You don't have to envy me anymore.

17:26.839 --> 17:28.560
You can also do whatever you want.

17:34.360 --> 17:37.640
Where did she go? She should see you off.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.120
It's alright.

17:39.200 --> 17:41.960
She's suffered so much. Maybe she's tired.

17:42.040 --> 17:43.520
Let her rest.

17:44.520 --> 17:46.040
Yeah. Well…

17:46.120 --> 17:47.280
Headmaster.

17:47.360 --> 17:48.920
Something went wrong.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.320
TO YOUR LADYSHIP

18:13.320 --> 18:14.400
Your Ladyship.

18:21.640 --> 18:24.320
Your Ladyship.
I have gone to accompany Pei Yu.

18:24.400 --> 18:27.080
The notes I compiled over years of study

18:27.160 --> 18:29.880
are stored in my cabinet
at the Imperial Medical Office.

18:29.960 --> 18:33.520
They contain many reflections
and analyses of classical prescriptions.

18:33.600 --> 18:35.720
Please deliver them to Physician Liu,

18:35.800 --> 18:37.720
so our colleagues may refer to them.

18:37.800 --> 18:39.280
The medical texts on the desk

18:39.360 --> 18:41.200
were given to me by my master.

18:41.280 --> 18:42.960
Keep them at the Benevolence Hall.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.560
Your Ladyship.

18:45.520 --> 18:46.640
Forgive me for not seeing you off

18:47.680 --> 18:49.440
or returning to the Western Capital.

18:50.480 --> 18:51.640
I'm so tired.

18:52.600 --> 18:54.880
I'm afraid I will let His Majesty down.

18:56.520 --> 18:59.320
TO YOUR LADYSHIP

19:24.840 --> 19:26.840
- It's you.
- What are you doing?

19:26.920 --> 19:28.760
Catching fireflies to read by their light?

19:28.840 --> 19:30.760
Headmaster puts out
the light at the Xu hour.

19:30.840 --> 19:32.200
But I have to copy your notes.

19:37.200 --> 19:38.200
Keep it down.

19:39.000 --> 19:40.240
Don't scare the fireflies away.

19:44.560 --> 19:45.800
Wait.

19:47.560 --> 19:50.040
Be careful. Fireflies fly around.

19:50.120 --> 19:51.840
That motionless object…

19:51.920 --> 19:52.800
might be a snake.

19:54.040 --> 19:55.960
Stop right there.

19:58.920 --> 20:02.200
I dare you to stop running.

20:08.040 --> 20:09.760
We've known each other so long,

20:09.840 --> 20:12.120
but you haven't told me your name.

20:12.800 --> 20:14.320
I don't have a name.

20:14.400 --> 20:15.800
Grandma said

20:15.880 --> 20:18.040
that she found me on the 13th
of the sixth month.

20:18.120 --> 20:19.640
So she named me Shisan.

20:19.720 --> 20:23.880
But she and the villagers
usually call me "wild girl".

20:24.880 --> 20:25.760
Shisan?

20:28.160 --> 20:30.080
That's not a good name.

20:30.160 --> 20:31.800
If you become a famous physician,

20:31.880 --> 20:33.400
you'll need a decent name.

20:35.920 --> 20:38.600
But I don't know any decent names.

20:40.560 --> 20:42.800
Grandma found you in the summer.

20:46.960 --> 20:49.920
Fireflies are all around tonight.

20:50.440 --> 20:53.080
Why don't we call you Xia Ying?

20:54.720 --> 20:55.800
Xia Ying.

20:58.680 --> 21:00.760
Alright. Then I'll be Xia Ying.

21:04.280 --> 21:05.480
Xia Ying.

21:09.280 --> 21:10.720
Xia Ying.

21:32.120 --> 21:33.120
Xia Ying.

21:36.520 --> 21:37.520
Pei Yu.

22:04.160 --> 22:07.320
Please take care
of Pei Yu and Ying's funeral.

22:14.600 --> 22:16.040
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

22:16.640 --> 22:18.600
Even if you don't say it,

22:18.680 --> 22:21.160
I will take care

22:21.760 --> 22:24.000
of Ying's funeral.

22:25.200 --> 22:26.720
I have only one request.

22:27.800 --> 22:30.800
Can you replace the portrait
with one of Pei Yu and Ying?

22:33.120 --> 22:36.360
All these years,
Pei Yu had been guarding Ying.

22:37.120 --> 22:38.880
Ying finally became a physician,

22:40.200 --> 22:43.720
but she covered up his crimes

22:43.800 --> 22:45.680
and violated the original intention
of saving people.

22:46.200 --> 22:48.200
Both of them are now dead.

22:50.000 --> 22:51.160
Let their story

22:52.320 --> 22:53.960
warn the future generations.

22:57.000 --> 22:58.880
I will do as you say,

22:59.600 --> 23:01.200
Your Ladyship.

23:22.560 --> 23:24.160
Pei Yu taught me…

23:25.840 --> 23:27.000
No.

23:27.080 --> 23:28.480
Ying taught me how to make that sachet.

23:29.160 --> 23:31.760
I've seen too many people
leave the Western Capital to survive.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.760
Only Ying

23:34.440 --> 23:36.400
left the Western Capital to seek death.

23:37.240 --> 23:40.480
Her life was short but full of hardship.

23:40.560 --> 23:43.920
She brought Pei Yu home
and finally found peace.

23:47.480 --> 23:50.880
But Ying really didn't want to go back.

23:52.520 --> 23:53.600
Perhaps it is for the best.

24:00.840 --> 24:02.400
Have you ever thought about leaving?

24:04.560 --> 24:05.480
Of course.

24:06.080 --> 24:08.000
But I have to discover the truth.

24:08.560 --> 24:11.160
I just don't know if I can survive.

24:14.120 --> 24:15.640
If it's so dangerous,

24:16.520 --> 24:17.720
can you give it up?

24:20.880 --> 24:22.120
If I give it up,

24:22.640 --> 24:25.680
what's the point
of trying so hard to survive?

24:32.600 --> 24:33.760
The epidemic is over.

24:34.280 --> 24:36.040
Why are you still carrying
the herb sachet?

24:39.240 --> 24:40.440
It comes in handy.

24:40.520 --> 24:42.680
We were traveling. I couldn't sleep.

24:42.760 --> 24:43.960
So I put some soothing herbs.

24:45.240 --> 24:46.440
Mindful of your well-being, huh?

24:47.920 --> 24:50.480
It's a nice formula. Want to try it?

24:55.600 --> 24:58.080
Just take mine. I just filled it up.

24:58.760 --> 24:59.760
I'll take yours.

25:08.200 --> 25:09.040
Mr. Xiao.

25:10.840 --> 25:12.800
Can you accompany me
to Ping'en County in Mingzhou?

25:12.880 --> 25:14.160
Ping'en County?

25:14.800 --> 25:17.080
I remembered someone
who suddenly left the capital.

25:18.800 --> 25:21.960
WU'S MANOR, PING'EN COUNTY, MINGZHOU

25:32.600 --> 25:34.520
Greetings, Your Ladyship, Mr. Xiao.

25:35.680 --> 25:36.600
Please take a seat.

25:44.280 --> 25:46.680
I didn't know you were coming.

25:47.280 --> 25:49.840
Master will be here in half a ke.

25:49.920 --> 25:50.920
Sorry for the wait.

25:51.600 --> 25:54.000
It's my fault that I came uninvited.

25:54.080 --> 25:55.400
Auntie, spare the formality.

25:56.520 --> 25:58.680
My uncle and my mother grew up together.

25:58.760 --> 25:59.920
He is a senior family member.

26:00.000 --> 26:01.080
I don't mind waiting.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.880
Interesting decoration.

26:08.840 --> 26:11.240
It's your uncle's preference.

26:11.920 --> 26:14.320
Uncle's business must be a huge success.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.520
You know about it?

26:17.440 --> 26:18.880
The richest man in the Western Capital

26:18.960 --> 26:20.960
- had the same preference.
- Your Ladyship.

26:22.000 --> 26:23.160
That's an unlucky thing to say.

26:25.840 --> 26:27.200
Don't you have any children?

26:28.680 --> 26:31.960
Our son gets ill easily
and avoids seeing guests.

26:32.040 --> 26:33.080
Please forgive us.

26:36.320 --> 26:37.880
Master is back.

26:42.320 --> 26:43.800
Sorry for the wait, Your Ladyship.

26:44.400 --> 26:46.080
You sound so distant.

26:46.160 --> 26:48.760
Just call me Peiyi like before.

26:48.840 --> 26:52.520
But when I didn't call you
"Your Ladyship",

26:52.600 --> 26:54.120
you chased after me

26:54.200 --> 26:55.520
with your little wooden sword.

26:56.880 --> 26:58.840
I, Xiao Huaijin, pay respect to Mr. Wu.

26:59.440 --> 27:01.880
Mr. Xiao from the Astronomical Bureau.

27:01.960 --> 27:04.320
What a promising young man.

27:10.520 --> 27:12.040
You must be hungry.

27:12.640 --> 27:14.560
My love. Bring food and wine.

27:19.200 --> 27:22.000
How old is my cousin? Is he doing fine?

27:22.760 --> 27:23.760
He's six years old.

27:24.320 --> 27:26.280
He was born weak

27:26.880 --> 27:29.480
and introverted. But he's fine.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.800
Thank you for your concern.

27:34.760 --> 27:36.280
Lamb with apricot sauce.

27:37.000 --> 27:38.120
Sunflower leaf soup.

27:38.640 --> 27:40.000
Celery with vinegar.

27:40.080 --> 27:41.600
Fried asparagus. Yellow rice.

27:41.680 --> 27:43.640
All local famous dishes.

27:43.720 --> 27:45.960
This one is the best.

27:46.040 --> 27:47.560
It may be available
in the Western Capital,

27:47.640 --> 27:49.320
but it tastes far better here.

27:49.920 --> 27:53.520
The sliced raw fish is made
of freshly caught bass.

27:53.600 --> 27:55.480
Fortunately, I don't eat fish.

27:56.520 --> 27:57.800
You don't eat fish?

27:58.960 --> 28:01.040
Never order sliced raw fish for me.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.200
Fresh and sweet.

28:04.920 --> 28:07.520
- Your Ladyship. Please try it.
- Wait.

28:07.600 --> 28:10.400
Mr. Wu. In my humble opinion,

28:10.480 --> 28:13.280
it seems you may not be able
to fully enjoy today's meal.

28:13.360 --> 28:14.720
Please elaborate.

28:15.320 --> 28:17.120
Today is Yisi. Yi wood belongs to fire.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.480
This is also the reason

28:18.560 --> 28:20.160
why you hold the banquet in this hall.

28:20.760 --> 28:24.760
On a fire-dominated day,
one should avoid water-element foods.

28:25.720 --> 28:26.800
I dare speak boldly.

28:26.880 --> 28:29.520
If I am mistaken,
I ask for your forgiveness.

28:30.320 --> 28:32.520
You are indeed as renowned as they say.

28:33.320 --> 28:34.760
Thank you for reminding me.

28:34.840 --> 28:35.960
Otherwise,

28:36.040 --> 28:38.520
indulging my appetite today

28:38.600 --> 28:41.600
might have disrupted Mr. Xu's intentions.

28:44.600 --> 28:46.000
Who is this Mr. Xu?

28:46.640 --> 28:48.440
Could he be more impressive than Mr. Xiao?

28:49.560 --> 28:51.400
Both are impressive.

28:51.480 --> 28:53.240
Mr. Xu

28:53.320 --> 28:55.080
is a hermit sage

28:55.160 --> 28:56.960
from the nearby Qingtan Town.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.280
His name is Xu Daoyin.

28:59.360 --> 29:01.000
He's been giving me a lot of advice.

29:01.680 --> 29:02.920
Ever since we came here,

29:03.000 --> 29:05.240
he's been blessing us

29:05.320 --> 29:07.640
in big and small affairs of life.

29:07.720 --> 29:11.360
I couldn't come out to greet you in time

29:11.440 --> 29:14.720
because I had to chant
during the You hour.

29:15.440 --> 29:16.880
Please forgive me.

29:17.480 --> 29:18.360
Then,

29:18.960 --> 29:20.160
will you be able to try

29:20.240 --> 29:22.080
the sliced raw fish?

29:22.880 --> 29:24.400
Her Ladyship should

29:24.480 --> 29:26.800
- avoid water…
- When tragedy hit that year,

29:26.880 --> 29:28.840
I fell into the Moonlit Pond
and almost drowned.

29:29.680 --> 29:31.520
Since then, I've never had fish again.

29:34.200 --> 29:36.400
You resigned and left
the Western Capital that year.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.320
So you didn't know.

29:39.000 --> 29:39.960
No wonder.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.480
I haven't asked you

29:43.160 --> 29:45.320
why you suddenly resigned that year.

29:45.400 --> 29:47.080
No one practiced sword with me afterward.

29:48.680 --> 29:50.360
I was in poor health.

29:50.880 --> 29:52.280
Being an official in the capital

29:52.880 --> 29:54.160
was hard work, after all.

29:54.760 --> 29:56.320
So I resigned from office

29:56.400 --> 29:58.520
and came to my wife's hometown with her.

30:01.480 --> 30:02.520
Someone.

30:03.160 --> 30:05.280
Take the sliced raw fish away.

30:08.800 --> 30:11.680
Take it to Young Master.

30:11.760 --> 30:12.600
Understood.

30:18.680 --> 30:21.400
I haven't been a thoughtful host
and have ruined your mood.

30:22.360 --> 30:24.280
Here. Let me toast you two.

30:34.680 --> 30:35.600
Forgive me.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.480
This way.

30:45.840 --> 30:48.720
I know why you're here today.

30:49.320 --> 30:52.760
Your father suffered
consecutive defeats and returned

30:53.280 --> 30:56.920
to the Western Capital.
He was depressed for quite a long time.

30:57.640 --> 30:59.120
When I visited him,

30:59.760 --> 31:03.000
I could sense the worry in his heart.

31:03.800 --> 31:05.640
He was the elder brother of His Majesty

31:06.280 --> 31:09.200
and a celebrated military commander
with a record of achievements.

31:09.280 --> 31:13.280
It was only natural
that he failed to bear such a heavy blow

31:13.360 --> 31:14.960
and had a breakdown.

31:15.640 --> 31:17.440
This may be hard for you to accept,

31:17.520 --> 31:19.920
but it is the truth.

31:22.680 --> 31:25.440
You were thriving
as the Crown Prince's aide,

31:26.280 --> 31:29.120
but suddenly retired due to poor health
after my parents passed away.

31:29.800 --> 31:31.520
Is there a connection
between these two events?

31:31.600 --> 31:33.360
Of course not.

31:33.440 --> 31:36.560
You used to bring me new clothes
on the Lantern Festival every year.

31:36.640 --> 31:38.560
But you didn't visit that day.

31:38.640 --> 31:41.280
Did you hear something in advance?

31:41.360 --> 31:42.840
How is that possible?

31:43.360 --> 31:45.440
I went to your manor at noon that day.

31:46.120 --> 31:49.040
You changed
into the new clothes on the spot.

31:50.920 --> 31:51.800
That's it.

31:52.560 --> 31:57.360
With your testimony,
I'm more certain that I was home that day.

32:02.280 --> 32:04.120
Sorry. The corridors wind like a maze.

32:04.200 --> 32:05.600
I was lost for a moment.

32:06.920 --> 32:08.080
Please be seated.

32:10.440 --> 32:12.720
You've traveled a long way here.

32:12.800 --> 32:14.760
Rest early after dinner.

32:14.840 --> 32:16.400
Tomorrow,

32:16.480 --> 32:18.800
I'll show you around the town.

32:29.800 --> 32:31.200
This area is prone
to dampness and mosquitoes.

32:31.280 --> 32:33.160
The guest rooms
have been closed for too long.

32:33.240 --> 32:35.560
It'll require extra fumigation
to be livable tonight.

32:35.640 --> 32:37.040
Please wait here.

32:37.120 --> 32:38.040
Much appreciated.

32:44.440 --> 32:46.040
Did you annoy Mr. Wu?

32:47.240 --> 32:48.560
He was feeling guilty.

32:50.600 --> 32:52.520
But how did you get lost

32:52.600 --> 32:54.080
with your extraordinary memory?

32:54.840 --> 32:56.120
Don't you think

32:56.200 --> 32:58.240
that Madam Wu is somewhat odd?

33:00.520 --> 33:03.400
Take it to Young Master.

33:03.480 --> 33:04.400
Understood.

33:17.600 --> 33:18.800
It's not for Young Master.

33:19.400 --> 33:21.600
- But Master…
- It's Madam again.

33:21.680 --> 33:22.880
Let's go.

33:29.920 --> 33:31.120
Take this and go.

33:31.200 --> 33:33.080
I told you that was not for Young Master.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.600
Don't get us into trouble.

33:56.360 --> 33:59.520
A child lives alone
in that remote courtyard?

34:02.000 --> 34:04.120
Mr. Wu appears to care about his son,

34:04.720 --> 34:07.080
but Madam Wu seems rather cold.

34:09.280 --> 34:10.800
It's such a big household.

34:10.880 --> 34:13.080
Why would they withhold a child's food?

34:14.440 --> 34:15.800
I smell secrets.

34:15.880 --> 34:17.199
But maybe I'm overthinking.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.760
Any progress?

34:19.840 --> 34:21.239
I tricked him.

34:21.320 --> 34:23.199
He's probably quite annoyed right now.

34:23.280 --> 34:26.880
When different accounts
of the same event sound nearly identical,

34:26.960 --> 34:28.480
there must be something fishy.

34:29.440 --> 34:30.360
It's alright.

34:30.440 --> 34:32.600
I have time to figure it out.

34:37.040 --> 34:38.360
I should have come much earlier.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.679
It's going to rain.

34:54.639 --> 34:57.200
GREAT VIRTUE TO EMBRACE THE WORLD

35:04.360 --> 35:08.200
WANG, SERVANT AT WU'S MANOR

35:10.520 --> 35:12.520
You lazybones. Get up.

35:15.840 --> 35:16.960
Master is still asleep?

35:17.040 --> 35:18.360
That's right.

35:26.680 --> 35:27.520
Master.

35:29.520 --> 35:30.640
Master…

35:38.440 --> 35:42.000
SECRETS OF AUSPICIOUS TIMES

35:45.280 --> 35:47.160
Madam, did you see
or hear anything last night?

35:48.400 --> 35:51.600
Madam has been living alone
in the back courtyard for years.

35:51.680 --> 35:52.960
So last night…

35:56.040 --> 35:57.240
Please wait.

35:57.840 --> 35:58.720
The authorities are coming.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.440
Your Ladyship doesn't need to go in.

36:00.520 --> 36:01.640
Don't you know who I am?

36:01.720 --> 36:02.920
Y-Yes, I do.

36:03.000 --> 36:04.480
So what are you waiting for?

36:05.280 --> 36:06.440
Your Ladyship.

36:06.520 --> 36:07.480
You can't take on this case.

36:07.560 --> 36:10.640
The crime scene is way too shocking.

36:12.720 --> 36:14.120
Then I want to see it even more.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.320
But…

36:17.320 --> 36:19.280
Master was injured in the lower body.

36:25.160 --> 36:27.960
Mr. Wu died miserably,
injured in the lower body.

36:28.040 --> 36:29.200
It is highly improper.

36:30.560 --> 36:31.360
That's right.

36:31.440 --> 36:34.920
Why doesn't Your Ladyship
wait for Magistrate Wen to bring people?

36:35.920 --> 36:37.160
The dead care little

36:37.240 --> 36:38.480
for the barriers drawn
between men and women.

36:49.520 --> 36:52.400
Even if Your Ladyship doesn't care,
someone else does.

36:52.480 --> 36:53.640
We're not in the palace.

36:53.720 --> 36:54.640
Let's be more cautious.

36:54.720 --> 36:57.280
If word gets out, people will find out

36:57.360 --> 36:58.600
about our detour.

37:00.040 --> 37:01.360
They'll know sooner or later.

37:01.440 --> 37:03.120
They can come and kill me.

37:03.200 --> 37:05.760
Then I'll figure out who they are.

37:05.840 --> 37:09.880
I know you're upset that he died
before you could figure anything out.

37:09.960 --> 37:11.560
But we should be more cautious now.

37:11.640 --> 37:13.200
But he died last night.

37:13.720 --> 37:14.960
I have to investigate.

37:15.040 --> 37:16.080
I don't trust anyone.

37:17.800 --> 37:18.800
Then let me do it.

37:18.880 --> 37:21.440
Get blindfolded and follow me.

37:21.520 --> 37:22.560
I'll be your eyes.

37:25.120 --> 37:26.800
If you trust me.

37:29.760 --> 37:30.720
Get a blindfold.

37:31.320 --> 37:32.480
Understood.

37:45.000 --> 37:47.640
Her Ladyship will follow me
into the room, blindfolded.

37:47.720 --> 37:49.640
There is nothing improper.

37:49.720 --> 37:51.200
If we still hear criticism,

37:51.280 --> 37:53.400
then it's you people
tarnishing the reputation

37:53.480 --> 37:54.880
of the royal clan.

37:54.960 --> 37:56.440
I will uncover the truth,

37:56.520 --> 37:59.520
even if it means a thousand fall,
none shall escape.

38:00.400 --> 38:01.560
Rest assured, Mr. Xiao.

38:01.640 --> 38:03.760
I dare not talk nonsense
about Her Ladyship.

38:03.840 --> 38:06.000
I don't know if you would dare.

38:06.520 --> 38:08.120
But you only have one life.

38:13.120 --> 38:14.040
What a pity.

38:14.120 --> 38:17.000
I didn't get to see
how you threatened him.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.440
It wasn't a threat.

38:19.520 --> 38:20.720
I was telling the truth.

38:23.360 --> 38:25.160
Your Ladyship. Please.

38:33.480 --> 38:34.320
Be careful.

38:46.960 --> 38:48.160
Heavy blood smell.

38:49.000 --> 38:50.600
You don't have to force yourself.

38:50.680 --> 38:52.880
With the door closed,
I can inspect the scene.

38:54.320 --> 38:56.240
We're alone here. Don't worry.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.600
I can manage.

39:01.480 --> 39:03.160
The censer stands at the center.

39:03.240 --> 39:04.320
You're facing the Kan position.

39:04.400 --> 39:06.080
According
to the Eight Trigrams orientation,

39:06.160 --> 39:08.600
north is Kan, south is Li,
east is Zhen, and west is Dui.

39:11.080 --> 39:12.760
As expected, the room
is meticulously arranged

39:12.840 --> 39:15.160
to attract fortune and prosperity.

39:15.760 --> 39:18.520
Doors and windows
show no signs of forced entry.

39:19.640 --> 39:22.440
In the Dui position, there is a bed
with a lamp on each side.

39:25.760 --> 39:26.880
The Zhen position has a window

39:26.960 --> 39:28.680
overlooking the bamboo garden.

39:28.760 --> 39:30.520
In front of the window

39:30.600 --> 39:32.080
sits a rosewood desk,

39:32.160 --> 39:33.640
on which are placed the stationery

39:34.440 --> 39:35.560
and three books.

39:47.360 --> 39:49.080
The Kan position features a screen

39:49.160 --> 39:51.080
with cabinets on both sides.

39:55.440 --> 39:56.960
The Qian position holds a tall stand

39:58.160 --> 39:59.800
with gold ingots in a porcelain dish.

40:00.400 --> 40:03.440
This is the room's wealth corner,
likely arranged to attract prosperity.

40:05.840 --> 40:07.600
None of these appears to have been moved.

40:08.760 --> 40:09.920
Examine the body.

40:21.120 --> 40:22.320
Above the bed

40:22.400 --> 40:24.400
hangs a horizontal beam
draped with red silk.

40:24.480 --> 40:26.240
Mr. Wu's upper body
is suspended from this beam,

40:27.000 --> 40:28.080
his arms hanging down,

40:30.160 --> 40:31.200
mouth wide open.

40:31.280 --> 40:33.400
Was anything ever stuffed inside?

40:35.320 --> 40:36.280
I can't tell.

40:36.360 --> 40:38.360
This will require examination
by the coroner.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.680
Cause of death?

40:41.920 --> 40:42.920
Wound in the lower body.

40:43.000 --> 40:44.520
The clothing is soaked in blood.

40:45.120 --> 40:46.920
Blood has flowed
from the bed to the floor.

40:47.000 --> 40:48.760
The color appears normal.

40:49.680 --> 40:51.240
No visible signs of poisoning.

40:51.840 --> 40:53.320
He died from excessive bleeding.

40:53.400 --> 40:55.280
Any other wounds?

40:57.160 --> 40:58.240
No.

41:06.800 --> 41:09.040
The joint has begun to stiffen
but can still be bent.

41:09.120 --> 41:11.040
You should be able to estimate
the time of death.

41:14.600 --> 41:15.960
Magistrate Wen, please wait.

41:16.040 --> 41:17.840
It's a murder case. How can I wait?

41:17.920 --> 41:18.840
Magistrate Wen.

41:20.360 --> 41:22.120
Her Ladyship is inspecting the scene.

41:23.360 --> 41:25.560
WEN YUQING, PING'EN COUNTY MAGISTRATE

41:25.640 --> 41:26.840
We're in the main hall.

41:26.920 --> 41:28.240
We never came.

41:29.560 --> 41:30.400
We never came.

41:36.000 --> 41:38.920
The time of death is estimated
to be after midnight.

41:50.760 --> 41:52.280
Both wrists show abrasions,

41:52.880 --> 41:54.560
likely caused by struggling

41:54.640 --> 41:56.120
against rope bindings.

41:56.200 --> 41:58.160
Please examine closely.

41:58.240 --> 42:00.080
Has the blood at the wound site dried?

42:02.600 --> 42:03.720
Not yet.

42:05.080 --> 42:07.480
Thank you, Mr. Xiao. We can leave now.

42:16.880 --> 42:17.720
Your Ladyship.

42:19.040 --> 42:19.960
We've checked around.

42:20.040 --> 42:22.040
No valuables were lost.

42:22.640 --> 42:24.120
The murderer was not looking for money.

42:24.200 --> 42:25.840
Were any others injured?

42:26.520 --> 42:29.840
No. Even the two guards
stationed outside the room were unharmed.

42:35.600 --> 42:36.640
Leave us.

42:40.920 --> 42:42.200
Your Ladyship.

42:42.280 --> 42:44.480
The victim died from heavy bleeding
after being struck

42:44.560 --> 42:45.680
in the lower body

42:45.760 --> 42:47.640
with a blunt object,
likely a wooden implement

42:47.720 --> 42:48.920
with sharp edges.

42:49.000 --> 42:50.240
Not a simple club or rod.

42:50.320 --> 42:51.360
Based on the amount of blood,

42:51.440 --> 42:54.040
it appears the deceased
had taken blood-activating medication.

42:54.640 --> 42:56.000
What medication?

43:00.920 --> 43:03.640
Traces of medicinal residue
were found on the victim's clothing,

43:03.720 --> 43:05.640
but further analysis is needed.

43:06.960 --> 43:09.360
Sichuan lovage, Dang Gui,
and cinnamon bark.

43:10.320 --> 43:11.960
Was anything stuffed into the mouth?

43:12.040 --> 43:13.200
No.

43:13.280 --> 43:15.520
The open mouth was a result of agony.

43:16.640 --> 43:19.240
The victim screamed before death?

43:19.960 --> 43:22.000
Did you hear thunder last night?

43:23.320 --> 43:25.360
The big tree in the courtyard
was struck down.

43:25.440 --> 43:26.680
But I didn't hear thunder.

43:27.280 --> 43:30.000
This is strange. Everyone slept well.

43:30.080 --> 43:32.640
Those who would get up to use the restroom
didn't wake up, either.

43:32.720 --> 43:35.480
Those who snore
didn't wake up their roommates.

43:36.400 --> 43:37.680
Drugs.

43:37.760 --> 43:41.240
Someone must have drugged everyone
in the manor.

43:42.240 --> 43:43.960
Was it in the food?

43:44.040 --> 43:45.920
Or in the water.

43:46.520 --> 43:48.240
But Mr. Wu was wide awake.

43:48.320 --> 43:50.640
Otherwise, he wouldn't have struggled.

43:50.720 --> 43:52.640
We ate and drank the same things.

43:56.480 --> 43:58.120
This area is prone
to dampness and mosquitoes.

43:58.200 --> 44:00.160
The guest rooms
have been closed for too long.

44:00.240 --> 44:02.560
It'll require extra fumigation
to be livable tonight.

44:04.560 --> 44:06.920
Collect samples of the mosquito repellent.

44:07.000 --> 44:09.160
One from the deceased. One from others.

44:09.920 --> 44:10.960
Understood.

44:15.920 --> 44:17.120
Here, Your Ladyship.

44:17.200 --> 44:19.120
This is from my master's room.

44:22.840 --> 44:24.880
Perilla, mugwort,

44:26.960 --> 44:28.320
sulphur, tangerine peel, cloves?

44:28.400 --> 44:31.960
That's right. Master used that formula
for his incense.

44:33.480 --> 44:36.520
This is the incense from the other rooms.

44:39.640 --> 44:40.720
Datura flower.

44:41.600 --> 44:43.000
It's a drug.

44:46.280 --> 44:48.000
That's why no one heard anything.

44:48.080 --> 44:49.800
The murderer added Datura flowers

44:49.880 --> 44:51.520
to the incense

44:51.600 --> 44:53.720
and put everyone in the manor to sleep.

44:53.800 --> 44:56.760
Mr. Wu called for help,
but no one heard him.

44:56.840 --> 44:58.920
The murderer was so cruel.
